0b4_1200x1200.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369930778"},{"id":369870820,"date":"2026-10-25T13:19:55.109Z","text":"Sit long enough in the quiet, and even the ordinary starts showing signs of another dimension.  \n\n. ݁₊ ⊹ . ݁ ⟡ ݁ . ⊹ ₊ ݁.","likes":13,"restacks":3,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/17fe8d67-2aeb-4117-8a42-817374488423_1448x1086.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369870820"},{"id":369088591,"date":"2026-10-25T11:52:35.023Z","text":"✨","likes":18,"restacks":2,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/89ca6b07-7ed1-4602-a4aa-cddcc83ac2fe_1672x941.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369088591"},{"id":369803817,"date":"2026-10-25T11:33:25.369Z","text":"Thanks @Cael !  Your custom cursor looks amazing. 💘\n\nhttps://magickmicaart.substack.com/p/make-your-own-custom-cursor-for-substack\n\n ✨Get Cursor!  create your own prompt builder (link below) https://magickmica.github.io/get-cursor.html","likes":6,"restacks":0,"replies":1,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":"https://magickmica.github.io/get-cursor.html","url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369803817"},{"id":369616546,"date":"2026-10-25T03:22:50.396Z","text":"The goddess within you needs rest as much as radiance.","likes":17,"restacks":4,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369616546"},{"id":369563685,"date":"2026-10-25T02:00:00.181Z","text":"🛎️ The TV stays on forever ….","likes":13,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d0d1d779-4672-436d-a476-1945474db074_1111x1974.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369563685"},{"id":369557052,"date":"2026-10-25T01:00:40.591Z","text":"Imagine a timeline where you stop apologizing for the light you bring into the room. What would you create there?","likes":13,"restacks":3,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369557052"},{"id":369554931,"date":"2026-10-25T00:55:57.720Z","text":"❤️💎🧡💛🌠💚💎💙💜\n\nRest. Reboot. Re-enter the magick.","likes":6,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9947370a-2bf2-4f72-a382-c4981983d00e_1672x941.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369554931"},{"id":369548817,"date":"2026-10-25T00:42:49.762Z","text":"Meet me where imagination becomes a universe.","likes":14,"restacks":2,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369548817"},{"id":369488951,"date":"2026-10-24T22:43:52.930Z","text":"🗝️for later.","likes":43,"restacks":9,"replies":4,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f698a5a8-c7b4-4e0c-8878-0a3ff69607ea_1122x1402.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369488951"},{"id":369421647,"date":"2026-10-24T20:54:24.682Z","text":"I release what no longer reflects who I am becoming. I honor who I have been, reclaim my energy, and make room for what feels true now.\n\n▀▄▀▄▀▄ (new post)\n\nhttps://substack.com/home/post/p-221907011","likes":16,"restacks":3,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b0b81733-c665-4661-a1cc-b38301a18486_1027x1531.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369421647"},{"id":369382439,"date":"2026-10-24T19:57:32.492Z","text":"","likes":5,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369382439"},{"id":369095142,"date":"2026-10-24T14:00:02.441Z","text":"🪴Earth is not a resource, it’s a relationship.","likes":14,"restacks":2,"replies":2,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/bd481091-204a-481d-97c2-56c0d8aef492_1222x1833.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369095142"},{"id":369067939,"date":"2026-10-24T13:00:16.889Z","text":"this is the shift","likes":40,"restacks":9,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/27236064-0145-4c17-ad66-9632c989962d_1122x1402.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369067939"},{"id":369057970,"date":"2026-10-24T12:44:40.565Z","text":"“Can you find the magic? Look again. You’re standing on it.”","likes":18,"restacks":2,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8d6174d5-54ae-4e26-8650-ddbef024fe0f_2400x1808.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-369057970"},{"id":368969616,"date":"2026-10-24T11:00:00.232Z","text":"DON'T FOLLOW EVERYONE ELSE\n\nTHEY MAY BE WALKING IN THE WRONG DIMENSION\n\nCHOOSE YOUR PORTAL.","likes":14,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/fcb7622a-0cf9-4e6d-999b-731f098758a8_3072x5440.jpeg","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-368969616"},{"id":368992713,"date":"2026-10-24T10:41:06.550Z","text":"Haunt Morning.","likes":5,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/219e0776-a88e-4e42-a14b-e1154bffeabc_1122x1402.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-368992713"},{"id":368964923,"date":"2026-10-24T10:30:00.495Z","text":"","likes":8,"restacks":1,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d460e2de-fdf2-41b0-a6c6-213e6a77e717_1536x1024.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-368964923"},{"id":368974646,"date":"2026-10-24T09:58:50.763Z","text":"“The strange little things are often carrying the biggest messages.”","likes":8,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/35d5c6d1-8b13-4408-bdbe-6c038c80fa6b_1254x1254.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-368974646"},{"id":368957626,"date":"2026-10-24T09:17:15.804Z","text":"💖","likes":16,"restacks":3,"replies":2,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/ea26588c-5443-44ac-bfb6-dd8eb1f57868_1024x1536.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-368957626"},{"id":367801469,"date":"2026-10-24T08:26:57.832Z","text":"🌒","likes":3,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9f95a907-31dd-40e7-82f2-b55f0e42b431_2399x1355.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-367801469"},{"id":368932121,"date":"2026-10-24T08:12:35.185Z","text":"Insert coin.\n\nEnter Dream.  🌊","likes":22,"restacks":4,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/96868341-79a0-453e-98cf-796b86c6ab39_1369x1149.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-368932121"},{"id":368915764,"date":"2026-10-24T07:30:01.879Z","text":"✨","likes":8,"restacks":3,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a23a83d9-d38f-42eb-8aee-af8de7d3d3b1_1024x1024.jpeg","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-368915764"},{"id":368651997,"date":"2026-10-23T21:30:49.405Z","text":"Imagine first. Explain later.","likes":6,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-368651997"},{"id":368643505,"date":"2026-10-23T21:18:06.453Z","text":".𖥔 ݁ ˖ ⋆˙⟡ᯓ★⊹.⋆🪐༘ ˖˚⏾⋆.˚","likes":5,"restacks":0,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d18e216a-4e75-4c4e-9b96-395b316783f8_1824x1024.jpeg","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-368643505"},{"id":368624979,"date":"2026-10-23T20:51:28.956Z","text":"🫖✨","likes":15,"restacks":3,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4c1a85d4-938a-4c0f-a965-b41b0e45a61e_1254x1254.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-368624979"},{"id":368622813,"date":"2026-10-23T20:48:27.516Z","text":"","likes":6,"restacks":2,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/bb49dcaf-035b-4054-8da8-e09c38a76184_541x171.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-368622813"},{"id":368600700,"date":"2026-10-23T20:18:01.261Z","text":"Silk does not apologize for being smooth.","likes":8,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-368600700"},{"id":368480588,"date":"2026-10-23T17:42:12.640Z","text":"“Everyone’s worried about the future. I’m worried about dropping a stitch in 1985 and accidentally unraveling 2026.","likes":15,"restacks":2,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5873e00c-c122-4dc7-856f-d61f40ce42de_1672x940.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-368480588"},{"id":364218764,"date":"2026-10-23T13:48:33.892Z","text":"🕯️✩₊˚.⋆🕸️⋆⁺₊✧🕯️","likes":9,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/23a7b90f-1599-4569-9041-aa253e8c29da_1456x971.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-364218764"},{"id":368183132,"date":"2026-10-23T11:28:46.085Z","text":"✨","likes":38,"restacks":7,"replies":4,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a5f01f78-ccf6-4f9e-8061-eca903d42fb7_1368x768.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-368183132"},{"id":368002598,"date":"2026-10-23T04:12:00.137Z","text":"✎﹏﹏﹏﹏","likes":14,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/03a730ff-cd65-41e4-98b0-9f64dcee574d_1448x1086.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-368002598"},{"id":367997884,"date":"2026-10-23T03:53:09.333Z","text":"“The forest is full of wonders, darling. It's the ordinary people you have to watch out for.”","likes":39,"restacks":12,"replies":2,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/39ac2076-98bc-4d81-88c0-05890c37c0b8_2336x1760.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-367997884"},{"id":367988716,"date":"2026-10-23T03:30:06.796Z","text":"🌛","likes":12,"restacks":4,"replies":4,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/98c878a0-2e29-4bb4-ba4d-3367b2d0c051_1024x1024.jpeg","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-367988716"},{"id":367828412,"date":"2026-10-22T22:07:46.650Z","text":"The empress stirred her tea clockwise to summon luck… and counterclockwise to summon chaos.","likes":16,"restacks":2,"replies":2,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/dc05f113-c407-41fe-b9a4-133044ca4a00_600x473.gif","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-367828412"},{"id":367798592,"date":"2026-10-22T21:22:43.629Z","text":"🍓₊˚⊹","likes":15,"restacks":3,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9b8f0564-2640-430d-90da-9592bdead90f_1680x944.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-367798592"},{"id":367785788,"date":"2026-10-22T21:04:21.134Z","text":"🎪⋆𐙚˚🎠⊹🎈♡🎡⋆.ೃ࿔*🍿🎢","likes":10,"restacks":0,"replies":2,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e87655c4-ab48-482a-a404-07868484bb72_940x1672.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-367785788"},{"id":367547785,"date":"2026-10-22T18:13:31.413Z","text":"Sneak peak ❄️\n\nWinter 2026-2027","likes":7,"restacks":0,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9c322607-3eac-47db-8cbc-cbc3df7a139d_1254x1254.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-367547785"},{"id":367526700,"date":"2026-10-22T16:12:00.161Z","text":"“I stopped asking the universe for a sign. The Moon lit up every screen in Wonderland and spelled my name in stardust.”","likes":21,"restacks":6,"replies":4,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/ba2847ba-5e30-4b73-868b-4e5e5f7616b2_1111x1656.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-367526700"},{"id":366880208,"date":"2026-10-22T15:22:57.763Z","text":"🔥","likes":26,"restacks":8,"replies":4,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/083dc5e2-63e8-4e90-910c-d8fb9c5f0e50_1254x1254.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-366880208"},{"id":367432366,"date":"2026-10-22T14:01:24.820Z","text":"Wonder looks really good on you!","likes":11,"restacks":0,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-367432366"},{"id":367429645,"date":"2026-10-22T13:48:36.531Z","text":"","likes":8,"restacks":2,"replies":1,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-367429645"},{"id":367424944,"date":"2026-10-22T13:42:54.020Z","text":"I protect my peace like a rare ecosystem.","likes":31,"restacks":8,"replies":4,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/7e78d69d-3d45-4dee-bf3a-f334e5890c6a_1200x1200.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-367424944"},{"id":367219718,"date":"2026-10-22T09:55:00.142Z","text":"Some like it hot. I prefer my magic frosty.","likes":13,"restacks":4,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/fd572ead-d90f-4152-b0ed-2a92a56e796d_1027x1531.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-367219718"},{"id":367208089,"date":"2026-10-22T06:49:40.227Z","text":"Some endings are just trapdoors installed by the future.","likes":9,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-367208089"},{"id":367204887,"date":"2026-10-22T06:40:58.583Z","text":"🌛","likes":6,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1a503103-a2c5-4008-b83d-caef1719daa8_1334x1179.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-367204887"},{"id":367025450,"date":"2026-10-22T00:30:00.342Z","text":"✨","likes":14,"restacks":2,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/fa301f7e-bcd1-41ff-865b-bbe43d95bfd6_1122x1402.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-367025450"},{"id":367022446,"date":"2026-10-22T00:00:07.058Z","text":"\"I have been many things in many worlds. In this one, I choose to be alive to the wonder.”","likes":9,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/86be7ee3-521a-4c9f-bc15-f54e86059457_1402x1122.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-367022446"}]}